From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:43:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: take the remaining wcids off the phy tx_list at reset

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/2c2df658a5575060816e3e970699f87c332119ec
Fixes: 065c79df595a ("wifi: mt76: mt7915: fix list corruption after hardware restart")
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261119124352.1842164-3-nbd@nbd.name
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mac80211.c b/mac80211.c
index a07eac5..07af69b 100644
--- a/mac80211.c
+++ b/mac80211.c
@@ -893,7 +893,11 @@ static void mt76_reset_phy(struct mt76_phy *phy)
 	if (!phy)
 		return;
 
-	INIT_LIST_HEAD(&phy->tx_list);
+	spin_lock_bh(&phy->dev->tx_lock);
+	while (!list_empty(&phy->tx_list))
+		list_del_init(phy->tx_list.next);
+	spin_unlock_bh(&phy->dev->tx_lock);
+
 	phy->num_sta = 0;
 	phy->chanctx = NULL;
 	mt76_roc_complete(phy);
